    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... the cycle doesn't stop. i'll go home, sleep for a few hours, and then it's just back to the same blood and the same screaming. i feel like i'm just a witness to a losing battle. like, why am i even still participating in this? does any of it even matter in the end?",
